\par\par \b \uc2  Zloty steady near highs, c.bank remains passive. \b0\par\par\uc2 385 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 Oktober 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  WARSAW, Oct 9 (Reuter) - The zloty held flat in light trade on Thursday, closing near Wednesday's three-month high as external factors such as the Bundesbank's decision to up its repo rate took centre stage, dealers said. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  (NBP) refrained from \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  against the zloty on Thursday, leaving the local unit drifting around key psychological resistance at one percent from parity. \par \par \uc2  "Trade was lighter on Thursday as players waited for the Bundesbank rate decision and amid continued uncertainty about possible NBP \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said Witold Wozniak, \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer at Deutsche Bank Polska SA. \par \par \uc2  Bundesbank increased its repo rate to 3.30 percent from 3.00 percent and left its discount and lombard rates unchanged. \par \par \uc2  The zloty closed at 0.96/0.89 percent above parity against Wednesday's three-month high at 0.98/0.90 percent. \par \par \uc2  It was at 3.3920/50 to the dollar, against 3.4025/50 on Wednesday and at 1.9466/75 to the mark, against 1.9360/80. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said foreigners were not active on the secondary bill market as players focused on Monday's 1.5 billion zloty T-bill tender. "Foreigners may be waiting for upcoming treasury tenders and were not very active today," said Andrzej Fiderkiewicz, dealer at Societe Generale in Warsaw. \par \par \uc2  Dealers were mixed about whether the zloty would seek higher ground on Friday, but many expected it to gain once Poland's new cabinet was announced, especially if pro-market Freedom Union (UW) had a large role in the country's finances. \par \par \uc2  "One percent may be a prelude before the zloty tests its upside next week after the cabinet is known, along with the role of (UW leader Leszek) Balcerowicz," Wozniak said. \par \par \uc2  Dealers also said that the zloty could be subject to increased speculative capital flows in the near term. \par \par \uc2  On the money market one-day deposits slightly eased due to surplus cash on the market at the start of monthly reserves. \par \par \uc2  Overnight rates closed at 22.70/23.10 percent against opening's 22.80/23.10. Tomorrow/next ended at 22.80/23.35 percent against Wednesday's 23.00/23.35. \par \par \uc2  -- Pawel Kozlowski +48 22 653 9700 \par \par \uc2  E-mail: warsaw.newsroom@reuters.com \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011001dta9019j8\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
