\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Poland \highlight\uc2  Zloty Up Vs Basket;  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Level Debated \b0\par\par\uc2 192 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 Oktober 1997\par 11:48\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  WARSAW (AP-Dow Jones)--The Polish zloty gained against a basket of \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  Wednesday amid speculation about when the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to halt its rise. \par \par \uc2  Around 0930 GMT, the dollar was at 3.4155 zlotys, down from 3.4180 zlotys at the opening but up from Tuesday's fixing of 3.4075 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  The Deutsche mark was at 1.9398 zlotys, down from 1.9420 zlotys at the opening and from Tuesday's fixing of 1.9490 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  surprised dealers by not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  Tuesday afternoon, even though the zloty rose to more than 0.5% above the midpoint of its trading band. \par \par \uc2  The 0.5% level had been stringently guarded by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  almost daily over the past two weeks to buy dollars for zlotys. \par \par \uc2  On Wednesday, dealers were wondering what level the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will now tolerate. Andrzej Fiderkiewicz, a dealer at Societe Generale, said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  may allow the zloty to move to 0.8% above the midpoint before stepping in. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 08-10-97 \par \par \uc2  0948GMT \par \par \uc2  1167 1854 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dta807kvv\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal