\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Poland \highlight\uc2  Zloty Up Slightly Vs Basket;  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Expected \b0\par\par\uc2 357 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 Oktober 1997\par 11:17\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  WARSAW (AP-Dow Jones)--The Polish zloty was moderately stronger against the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket early Tuesday, and dealers said continued advances would likely prompt another round of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Around 0902 GMT, the dollar was at 3.4158 zlotys, down slightly from 3.4165 zlotys at the opening and up from Monday's fixing of 3.4185 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  The Deutsche mark was at 1.9456 zlotys, down from 1.9470 zlotys at the opening and up slightly from Monday's fixing of 1.9440 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said they expected foreign investors to sell hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  as they settled transactions for the purchase of Polish Treasury bills and bonds at recent auctions. \par \par \uc2  The National Bank of Poland was expected to buy hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the afternoon, following its almost daily practice of the past two weeks. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said there was an unusually large order to sell dollars in the offing, one that could move the exchange rate. \par \par \uc2  'It's a significant amount,' one dealer said. But he said the client was waiting for a 'favorable rate.' \par \par \uc2  Upward pressure on the zloty has been building since the Sept. 21 parliamentary election. The victor, Solidarity Electoral Action (AWS) is now in talks with the Freedom Union (UW) on forming a coalition government. \par \par \uc2  'If the talks go smoothly and a government is formed quickly, then we'll see even more foreign investors coming on to the market,' said Konrad Kolaszynski, a dealer at Amerbank. \par \par \uc2  The National Bank of Poland set the parity rate for the dollar at 3.4353 zlotys and for the mark at 1.9557 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  The dollar was trading at 0.57% below its parity rate, and the mark was at 0.52% below its parity rate. \par \par \uc2  The Polish zloty is fixed to a basket of five Western \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  and is devalued at a rate of 1% per month. It is theoretically allowed to fluctuate within plus or minus 7% of the central parity rate. \par \par \uc2  Overnight money market rates were indicated at between 23.40% and 23.50%. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 07-10-97 \par \par \uc2  0917GMT \par \par \uc2  1167 1854 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dta707kzt\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
