\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Poland Central Bank \highlight\uc2  Buys Dlrs -2: Second  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Friday \b0\par\par\uc2 239 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 Oktober 1997\par 14:08\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  WARSAW (AP-Dow Jones)--The National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market Friday afternoon, buying dollars for zlotys at 3.4323 zlotys, a dealer said. \par \par \uc2  The dealer said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought $10 million. \par \par \uc2  A dealer at another bank said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  earlier had bought dollars for zlotys at 3.4322 zlotys. The dealer said the amount was 'symbolic.' \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  when the zloty was trading at about 0.53% above the midpoint of its trading band against a basket of Western \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Around 1150 GMT, following the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the dollar was quoted at 3.4335 zlotys, up from Thursday's fixing of 3.4220 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  The Deutsche mark was quoted at 1.9320 zlotys, down from Thursday's fixing of 1.9365 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  The Polish zloty is fixed to a basket of five Western \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  and is devalued at a rate of 1% per month. It is theoretically allowed to fluctuate within plus or minus 7% of the central parity rate, but the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has held the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  within a much tighter range. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  almost daily in the past two weeks to keep the zloty from rising to more than 0.5% above the parity rate. \par \par \uc2  Overnight money market rates were indicated at between 23.30% and 23.60%. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 03-10-97 \par \par \uc2  1208GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dta307bzy\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
