\par\par \b \uc2  Poland  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2  Buys Dlrs -2: Also At 3.4220 Zlotys \b0\par\par\uc2 363 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 September 1997\par 14:04\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  WARSAW (AP-Dow Jones)--The National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on Tuesday to buy dollars for zlotys at the level of 3.4205 zlotys, a dealer said. \par \par \uc2  The bank bought $5 million, the dealer said. The \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  could not be confirmed at the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which does not comment on its market activities. \par \par \uc2  A dealer at another major bank said that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had also bought dollars for zlotys at the level of 3.4220 zlotys. The amount was also $5 million, the dealer said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  came when the zloty threatened to move up to more than 0.5% above the midpoint of its trading band against a basket of Western \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . 'The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  wanted to show that (the exchange rate) must be 0.5%,' a dealer said. \par \par \uc2  Around 1140 GMT, following the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the dollar was quoted at 3.4220 zlotys, unchanged from the opening of 3.4220 zlotys at the opening and up from Monday's fixing of 3.4170 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  The Deutsche mark was quoted at 1.9365 zlotys, up from 1.9340 zlotys at the opening and from Monday's fixing of 1.9380 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the foreign demand for Polish Treasury bonds, which are to be sold at auction on Wednesday, had been pushing up the zloty against the basket. \par \par \uc2  The Polish zloty is fixed to a basket of five Western \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  and is devalued at a rate of 1% per month. It is theoretically allowed to fluctuate within plus or minus 7% of the central parity rate, but the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  wants to keep a lid on its upward range, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  A dealer predicted that following the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would fix the zloty at less than 0.5% above the midpoint. The fixing is generally meant to reflect market levels. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Tuesday had been widely expected. It was the fifth day of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to stem the rise of the zloty since Sept. 22, the day after Poland's parliamentary election. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 30-09-97 \par \par \uc2  1204GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt9u07d37\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
