\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Poland \highlight\uc2 's Zloty Steady Vs Basket As  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Looms \b0\par\par\uc2 375 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 September 1997\par 10:34\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  WARSAW (AP-Dow Jones)--The Polish zloty was steady against the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket on Tuesday as the threat of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  loomed. \par \par \uc2  Around 0900 GMT, the dollar was at 3.4245 zlotys, up from 3.4220 zlotys at the opening and from Monday's fixing of 3.4170 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  The Deutsche mark was at 1.9325 zlotys, down from 1.9340 zlotys at the opening and from Monday's fixing of 1.9380 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the zloty was tracking movements in the dollar-mark on international markets and was steady at about 0.5% above the midpoint of its trading band. \par \par \uc2  The market was subdued and banks hesitated to sell hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  for zlotys, said a dealer at Societe Generale. 'Some banks fear \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ,' the dealer said. \par \par \uc2  On Monday afternoon, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to buy dollars for zlotys between the levels of 3.1460 zlotys and 3.1480 zlotys. At the time, the zloty had risen to more than 0.5% above the midpoint, which is now seen as the informal upper limit for the zloty tolerated by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  'The deviation (from the parity rate) won't go beyond 0.5%,' predicted Malgorzata Sawicka, a dealer at Bank Handlowy. \par \par \uc2  The Societe Generale dealer said upward pressure on the zloty could come later when foreign investors place orders for Treasury bills being offered at Wednesday's auction. \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  could come in the afternoon, as it has in the past week, the dealer said. \par \par \uc2  The National Bank of Poland set the parity rate for the dollar at 3.4381 zlotys and for the mark at 1.9452 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  The dollar was trading at 0.40% below its parity rate, and the mark was at 0.65% below its parity rate. \par \par \uc2  The Polish zloty is fixed to a basket of five Western \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  and is devalued at a rate of 1% per month. It is allowed to fluctuate within plus or minus 7% of the central parity rate. \par \par \uc2  Overnight money market rates were indicated at between 24.30% and 24.60%, down from between 27.10% and 27.80% on Monday. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 30-09-97 \par \par \uc2  0834GMT \par \par \uc2  1167 1854 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt9u07bsh\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
