\par\par \b \uc2  Poland Zloty Gains Slightly Vs Basket In Calm Trading \b0\par\par\uc2 383 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 September 1997\par 11:46\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  WARSAW (AP-Dow Jones)--The Polish zloty gained slightly against the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket in calm trading Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  'The market has calmed down' following \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to buy dollars late Tuesday afternoon, said Marcin Trzygowski, a dealer at Bank Polska Kasa Opieki. \par \par \uc2  Around 0921 GMT Wednesday, the dollar was at 3.4288 zlotys, from 3.4380 zlotys at the opening and from Tuesday's fixing of 3.4425 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  The Deutsche mark was at 1.9243 zlotys, up from 1.9229 zlotys at the opening and from Tuesday's fixing of 1.9185 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  On Tuesday, shortly before the daily fixing, the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to buy dollars for zlotys at several banks, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought dollars at levels ranging from 3.4380 zlotys to 3.4430 zlotys, dealers said. They estimated the scale of the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  at between $25 million and $30 million. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had given a clear signal that it won't allow the zloty to move up to more than 0.5% above the midpoint of its trading band. \par \par \uc2  Renewed \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  appeared unlikely, dealers said Wednesday, because the market was stable. \par \par \uc2  However, Trzygowski said a big downward move by the dollar against the mark could bring life to the Polish market and boost the zloty against the dollar. \par \par \uc2  Malgorzata Sawicka, a dealer at Bank Handlowy, predicted that the Polish \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  will continue to gain strength as foreign investors, hearted by the results of Sunday's Parliamentary election, pour funds into Polish securities. \par \par \uc2  'We'll see a supply of hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  from foreign investors,' Sawicka said. \par \par \uc2  The National Bank of Poland set the parity rate for the dollar at 3.4458 zlotys and for the mark at 1.9303 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  The dollar was trading at 0.49% below its parity rate, and the mark was at 0.32% below its parity rate. \par \par \uc2  The Polish zloty is fixed to a basket of five Western \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  and is devalued at a rate of 1% per month. It is allowed to fluctuate within plus or minus 7% of the central parity rate. \par \par \uc2  Overnight money market rates were indicated at between 23.00% and 24.20%. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 24-09-97 \par \par \uc2  0946GMT \par \par \uc2  1167 1854 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt9o075z1\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
