\par\par \b \uc2  Poland Zloty Seen Rising Further On Coalition Hopes \b0\par\par\uc2 258 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 22 September 1997\par 16:40\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  WARSAW (AP-Dow Jones)--The Polish zloty took a wild ride on Monday in reaction to Sunday's election results, but dealers said the outlook is positive. \par \par \uc2  They said favorable reaction to the election victory by Solidarity Electoral Action (AWS) and strong foreign demand for Polish securities should push up the zloty in coming days. \par \par \uc2  'The market is optimistically inclined toward the zloty,' said Jaroslaw Krol, a dealer at ABN Amro bank. \par \par \uc2  The zloty gained sharply in early dealing Monday morning following news that AWS had defeated the ruling Democratic Left Alliance (SLD) in the parliamentary election. \par \par \uc2  Market participants were particularly heartened by the strong third-place finish of the reform-minded Freedom Union (UW) party and by the likelihood that UW would form a coalition with AWS, thus tempering that party's trade-unionist tendencies. \par \par \uc2  But later on Monday morning Polish banks, expecting \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to damp the zloty's rise and hoping to ride the dollar's rise against the Deutsche mark, started selling the Polish \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers said. \par \par \uc2  When the National Band of \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland\b0 \highlight\uc2  finally \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to buy dollars at the level of 3.4370 zlotys, the zloty was already on its way down, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  On Monday afternoon, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  fixed the dollar at 3.4445 zlotys, up from Friday's fixing of 3.4285 zlotys. It fixed the mark at 1.9210 zlotys, down from Friday's fixing of 1.9265 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 22-09-97 \par \par \uc2  1440GMT \par \par \uc2  1167 1854 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt9m071wf\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
