\par\par \b \uc2  POLISH C.BANK OFFICIAL SEES STRONGER ZLOTY - PAPER. \b0\par\par\uc2 198 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 August 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  WARSAW, Aug 9 (Reuter) - The Polish zloty should strengthen against its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket after its recent fall, caused by last month's outflow of speculative foreign capital, the head of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  department said. \par \par \uc2  "I belive that after a brief weakening, the zloty will strengthen," Krzysztof Majczuk told the Gazeta Wyborcza daily. \par \par \uc2  He said the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland\b0 \highlight\uc2  (NBP) did not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  while the zloty fell to record lows last month because it did not want foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  speculators to profit. \par \par \uc2  "We did not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  because we wanted speculative foregin capital, which was selling zlotys, to buy dollars at less favourable rates," Majczuk was quoted as saying. \par \par \uc2  On Friday the zloty closed at 0.74 percent below its parity rate, up from record lows around minus 5.7 percent in mid-July. \par \par \uc2  The NBP monetary policy head Jerzy Stopyra also told the Rzeczpospolita daily on Saturday that zloty was no longer under downward pressure on the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. \par \par \uc2  "In the last days there were no speculative dollar purchases (on the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market)," Stopyra said. \par \par \uc2  -- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020040131dt8900806\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picw