\par\par \b \uc2  Poland's Zloty Recovers Strongly Vs Dollar \b0\par\par\uc2 270 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 22 Juli 1997\par 11:15\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  WARSAW (AP-Dow Jones)--Strong selling of western \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , particularly of the dollar, led to a substantial appreciation of the Polish zloty Tuesday against the basket of \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  to which it is linked. \par \par \uc2  Around 0850 GMT, the dollar was at 3.4400 zlotys, down from 3.4815 zlotys at the opening, and from Monday's fixing of 3.4680 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  The Deutsche mark was at 1.9050 zlotys, down from 1.9140 zlotys at the opening, and from Monday's fixing of 1.9320 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  'The zloty was seen as too weak,' said Piotr Czyzewski of ING Bank, explaining why investors were now selling hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Small-scale \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland\b0 \highlight\uc2  Monday in support of the zloty had also sent a signal to investors that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  judged the zloty to have declined enough, the dealer believed. \par \par \uc2  'It looks like the banks have taken note of that signal,' Czyzewski said. \par \par \uc2  The Polish zloty is fixed to a basket of five Western \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  and is devalued at a rate of 1% per month. It is allowed to fluctuate within plus or minus 7% of the central parity rate. \par \par \uc2  The National Bank of Poland set the parity rate for the dollar at 3.3773 zlotys Tuesday and for the mark at 1.8739 zlotys. The dollar was therefore trading at 1.86% above its parity rate, and the mark was 1.66% above its parity rate. \par \par \uc2  Overnight money market rates are indicated at between 23.30% and 23.60%. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 22-07-97 \par \par \uc2  0915GMT \par \par \uc2  1167 1854 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt7m05a9w\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
