\par\par \b \uc2  Poland Zloty Slips Vs Basket;  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2  Signal Awaited \b0\par\par\uc2 353 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 Juli 1997\par 10:56\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  WARSAW (AP-Dow Jones)--The Polish zloty continued to weaken slightly against the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  bask on Monday following Friday's sharp slide, slipping into the weak end of the band. \par \par \uc2  Around 0836 GMT, the dollar was quoted at 3.3560 zlotys, up from 3.3220 zlotys at the opening and from Friday's fixing of 3.3250 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  The Deutsche mark was quoted at 1.8828 zlotys, up from 1.8810 zlotys at the opening and from Friday's fixing of 1.8885 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said that turnover was low and that there was no visible trend either to buy or sell the Polish zloty. They attributed the drop in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  mainly to the strength of the dollar in international markets. \par \par \uc2  'The market is very cautious and there's no clear direction,' said a dealer at a Western bank. 'Everybody's waiting for a signal' from the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the dealer said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  once in recent months to keep the zloty from falling below the parity rate. But last week, National Bank of Poland President Hanna Gronkiewicz-Waltz said the level of the zloty was 'safe.' \par \par \uc2  Some dealers said the zloty could get a boost from Monday's auction of Treasury bills. The government, which is having trouble selling securities, could be forced to accept higher yields from foreign investors, said Wlodzimerz Osak, chief dealer at Bank Polska Kasa Opieki. \par \par \uc2  The National Bank of Poland set the parity rate for the dollar at 3.3465 zlotys and for the mark at 1.8819 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  The dollar was trading at 0.28% above its parity rate, and the mark was at 0.05% above its parity rate. \par \par \uc2  The Polish zloty is fixed to a basket of five Western \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  and is devalued at a rate of 1% per month. It is allowed to fluctuate within plus or minus 7% of the central parity rate. \par \par \uc2  Overnight money market rates were indicated at between 22.80% and 23.00%. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 14-07-97 \par \par \uc2  0856GMT \par \par \uc2  1167 1854 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt7e05487\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
