\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Poland \highlight\uc2  Zloty Surge Vs Dollar Halted By  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 350 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 Mai 1997\par 11:17\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  WARSAW (AP-Dow Jones)--The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on Friday to dampen a sudden surge of the zloty against the dollar. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the National Bank of Poland bought zlotys for dollars twice, first at the level of 3.1950 zlotys and then at 3.2000 zlotys. The scale of the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was described as small. \par \par \uc2  Around 0905 GMT, the dollar was at 3.1983 zlotys, up from 3.1910 zlotys at the opening and from Wednesday's fixing of 3.1980 zlotys. Markets were closed on Thursday. \par \par \uc2  The Deutsche mark was at 1.8820 zlotys, down from Wednesday's fixing of 1.8830 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought zlotys when the Polish \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  rose to about 1.5% above the parity rate against the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  'The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has given a signal' as to the desired level of the zloty, said Tomasz Wlad of Amerbank. Following the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , 'The market is very conservative,' he said. 'Banks are inactive.' \par \par \uc2  The zloty's surge started late on Wednesday, when the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  started to recover from several days of sharp declines triggered by the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  crisis in the Czech Republic. Dealers now say that the 'Czech effect' has dissipated. \par \par \uc2  The Polish \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's gains were sparked by foreign investors placing orders for shares in the initial public offering of Amica Wronki SA, a maker of household appliances, sources said. \par \par \uc2  The National Bank of Poland set the parity rate for the dollar at 3.2477 zlotys and for the mark at 1.9064 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  The dollar was trading at 1.52% below its parity rate, and the mark was at 1.28% below its parity rate. \par \par \uc2  The Polish zloty is fixed to a basket of five Western \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  and is devalued at a rate of 1% per month. It is allowed to fluctuate within plus or minus 7% of the central parity rate. \par \par \uc2  Overnight money market rates were indicated at between 24.75% and 24.95%. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 30-05-97 \par \par \uc2  0917GMT \par \par \uc2  1167 1854 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt5u03y31\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
