\par\par \b \uc2  Poland Zloty Steady Vs Basket; T-Bill Auction Eyed \b0\par\par\uc2 274 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 Mai 1997\par 11:32\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  WARSAW (AP-Dow Jones)--The Polish zloty is stable against the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket on Monday as dealers await the outcome of an auction for Treasury bills. \par \par \uc2  Around 0920 GMT, the dollar was at 3.1365 zlotys, up from 3.1335 zlotys at the opening but down from Friday's fixing of 3.1455 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  The Deutsche mark was at 1.8585 zlotys, down from 1.8609 zlotys at the opening but up from Friday's fixing of 1.8500 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  'The market is calm and stable,' said Tomasz Wolosz of Bank Rozwoju Eksportu. 'Everybody is waiting for the results of the Treasury bill auction.' \par \par \uc2  If a large number of orders for Treasury bills from foreign investors is accepted by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , then selling of hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the Polish market will occur, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  Demand for zlotys among foreign investors could push the Polish \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  up against the basket and trigger \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland\b0 \highlight\uc2  set the parity rate for the dollar at 3.3148 zlotys and for the mark at 1.9079 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  The dollar was trading at 2.44% below its parity rate, and the mark was at 2.60% below its parity rate. \par \par \uc2  The Polish zloty is fixed to a basket of five Western \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  and is devalued at a rate of 1% per month. It is allowed to fluctuate within plus or minus 7% of the central parity rate. \par \par \uc2 \f2