\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Poland \highlight\uc2 's Zloty Trading Up Vs Dollar, NBP Could  \highlight22\uc2 Intervene \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 257 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 Mai 1997\par 11:30\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  WARSAW (AP-Dow Jones)--The Polish zloty is falling in early trading Friday to levels at which traders said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  could \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The dip was a reaction to slight selling pressure against the U.S. dollar and Deutsche mark, traders said. \par \par \uc2  About 0900 GMT, the dollar was at 3.1478 zlotys, down from 3.1500 zlotys at the opening and from Thursday's fixing of 3.1545 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  The Deutsche mark was at 1.8473 zlotys, up from 1.8460 zlotys at the opening and from Thursday's fixing of 1.8420 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  'Everybody's expecting \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 ,' said Tomasz Wlad, a trader at Amerbank. \par \par \uc2  He speculated that the selling pressure seen on hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  was either the result of foreign investors buying into Polish bonds or shares or the result of a single order for a large client. \par \par \uc2  National Bank of Poland set the parity rate for the dollar at 3.2299 zlotys Friday and for the mark at 1.8949 zlotys. The dollar was therefore trading at 2.54% below its parity rate, the mark 2.51% below its rate. \par \par \uc2  The Polish zloty is fixed to a basket of five Western \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  and is devalued at a rate of 1% per month. It is allowed to fluctuate within plus or minus 7% of the central parity rate. \par \par \uc2  Overnight money market rates were indicated at 22.9% to 23.0%. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW 