\par\par \b \uc2  Zloty again forced below resistance by NBP buying. \b0\par\par\uc2 239 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 Mai 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  WARSAW, May 8 (Reuter) - The Polish zloty again came under upward pressure by foreign investor payments for T-bonds, but its gradual rise met another \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 -buying \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Dealers said that the market remained in a \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 -selling mood even after the $15 million \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but did not test higher levels, wary of sparking more \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  buying. \par \par \uc2  "The zloty remained strong all day, but its gains were capped by the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said Zbigniew Choszcz, chief dealer at Bank Gdanski SA. \par \par \uc2  The zloty closed at 2.53/2.50 percent from the trading band centre, flat from Wednesday's 2.53/2.49 percent close. \par \par \uc2  It closed at 3.1540/50 to the dollar, up from 3.1565/75 on Wednesday and at 1.8415/20 to the mark, down from 1.8350/60. \par \par \uc2  The NBP bought dollars at 3.1549 and 3.1555 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said it was not clear whether the market's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 -selling sentiment would set off another round of \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Friday, as most of foreign investors aleady made \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  deals ahead of the tender's May 12 value date. \par \par \uc2  On the money market rates held flat around 23 percent during the day. Overnight rates closed at 22.9/23.30 percent and tomorrow/next at 23.0/23.30. \par \par \uc2  -- Wojciech Moskwa +48 22 653 9700 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011002dt5805tou\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
