\par\par \b \uc2  Poland's Zloty Opens Lower Vs Basket, Gains Slightly \b0\par\par\uc2 331 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 Mai 1997\par 11:17\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  WARSAW (AP-Dow Jones)--The Polish zloty opened lower against the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket on Wednesday and gained minimally in the course of early trading. \par \par \uc2  Around 0850 GMT, the dollar was at 3.1596 zlotys, down from 3.1613 zlotys at the opening and from Tuesday's fixing of 3.1685 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  The Deutsche mark was at 1.8341 zlotys, up from Tuesday's fixing of 1.8305 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  The zloty opened higher against the dollar in reaction to the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's decline against the mark, dealers said. At the same time, the zloty fell against the mark. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said they didn't expect a repetition of Tuesday afternoon's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , when the bank bought marks for zlotys. The scale of the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was estimated at about 10 million marks. \par \par \uc2  'The \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  showed that the (National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) is very strongly guarding the level of 2.5%' above the parity rate for the dollar and mark, one dealer said. \par \par \uc2  The zloty was holding close to that level on Wednesday. 'If the market stays at this level, there will be no \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ,' said a dealer at Creditanstalt. \par \par \uc2  Some dealers added, however, that the zloty could move up if there is strong foreign demand for Polish Treasury bonds at Wednesday's auction. \par \par \uc2  The National Bank of Poland set the parity rate for the dollar at 3.2412 zlotys and for the mark at 1.8804 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  The dollar was trading at 2.47% below its parity rate, and the mark was at 2.46% below its parity rate. \par \par \uc2  The Polish zloty is fixed to a basket of five Western \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  and is devalued at a rate of 1% per month. It is allowed to fluctuate within plus or minus 7% of the central parity rate. \par \par \uc2  Two-day money market rates were indicated at between 23.00% and 23.30%. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 07-05-97 \par \par \uc2  0917GMT \par \par \uc2  1167 1854 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt57033vc\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
