\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Poland \highlight\uc2 's Zloty Stable Vs Basket; No  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Seen \b0\par\par\uc2 307 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 25 April 1997\par 11:28\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  WARSAW (AP-Dow Jones)--The Polish zloty is stable against the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket in sleepy trading Friday as it tracked minor movements in the dollar-Deutsche mark. \par \par \uc2  About 0903 GMT, the dollar was at 3.1488 zlotys, little changed from 3.1485 zlotys at the opening and down from Thursday's fixing of 3.1500 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  The Deutsche mark was at 1.8347 zlotys at that time, up from 1.8335 zlotys at the opening and from Thursday's fixing of 1.8320 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  In contrast with recent days, when the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  heavily to keep the zloty from rising, the market is quiet Friday. \par \par \uc2  'It's a day of rest,' one dealer said. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said banks are quoting cautiously to avoid provoking the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which has established a firm top limit of 2.5% above parity for the zloty. \par \par \uc2  'The market is behaving,' said Tomasz Nowakowski, a dealer at Bank Handlowy. \par \par \uc2  Some dealers predicted that upward pressure on the zloty will resume Monday, when foreign investors place orders to buy increasingly popular Polish Treasury bills. \par \par \uc2  In that case, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  could be prompted to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland\b0 \highlight\uc2  set the parity rate for the dollar at 3.2289 zlotys and for the mark at 1.8803 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  The dollar is trading at 2.49% below its parity rate, while the mark is at 2.43% below its parity rate. \par \par \uc2  The Polish zloty is fixed to a basket of five Western \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  and is devalued at a rate of 1% per month. \par \par \uc2  It is allowed to fluctuate within plus or minus 7% of the central parity rate. \par \par \uc2  One-week money market rates were indicated at 21.40% to 22.20%. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 25-04-97 \par \par \uc2  0928GMT \par \par \uc2  1167 1854 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt4p02vy5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
