\par\par \b \uc2  Polish NBP weakens zloty to aid exports - c.banker. \b0\par\par\uc2 294 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 23 April 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  WARSAW, April 23 (Reuter) - The National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland\b0 \highlight\uc2 's deputy president said that the bank's \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  that weakened the zloty by about 0.7 percent since last Thursday aimed to help exporters and keep a cap on the trade deficit. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has bought nearly $500 million of the domestic \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market through \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  since Thursday and knocked down the zloty to 2.5 percent from the parity rate from around three percent. \par \par \uc2  "(These \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) should support exports and act as a coolant for imports," Witold Kozinski told bankers at an annual banking association meeting. \par \par \uc2  "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's exchange rate as well as interest rate policy is aimed at stabilising the trade deficit," he added. \par \par \uc2  Over the first two months of this year the current account deficit amounted to $1.1 billion, against a $1.4 billion shortfall for all of 1996. \par \par \uc2  Kozinski said there were dangers in \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 , including large inflows of money supply-boosting foreign capital into Polish debt. But he said that such a small move in the zloty exchange rate would not push up consumer prices. \par \par \uc2  "This type of policy has its dangers...but we don't think that this move, which pushed the zloty down about 0.7 percentage points, will cause prices to move," Kozinski said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has recently increased open market \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  to sterilise much of the foreign investor inflows into Polish treasuries set off by the zloty's fall last week. \par \par \uc2  The NBP has been keeping real interest rates rising and market rates high since late 1996, to cool quickly growing domestic demand along with thirst for imported consumer goods. \par \par \uc2  -- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011002dt4n06q94\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
