\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Poland \highlight\uc2  Zloty Stable Vs Basket;  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Seen Unlikely \b0\par\par\uc2 322 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 22 April 1997\par 11:30\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  WARSAW (AP-Dow Jones)--The Polish zloty was little changed against the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket on Tuesday despite the dollar's sharp gains against the Deutsche mark. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said a repetition of Monday's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  appeared unlikely, since the zloty was trading at levels that are thought to satisfy the bank. \par \par \uc2  Around 0905 GMT, the dollar was at 3.1350 zlotys, up from 3.1308 zlotys, at the opening and from Monday's fixing of 3.1310 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  The Deutsche mark was at 1.8348 zlotys, down from Monday's fixing of 1.8365 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the zloty was tracking movements in the dollar-mark on international markets. \par \par \uc2  The recent sharp upward pressure on the zloty, connected with large foreign purchases of Polish Treasury bills and bonds, has abated somewhat, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  They added that banks are trying to avoid provoking \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which bought dollars for zlotys late last week and Monday. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has shown that it will not allow the Polish \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to rise to much more than an average of 2.5% above the parity rates for the dollar and mark. \par \par \uc2  'Everybody's trying to stay below 2.5%,' said a dealer at Bank Handlowy. \par \par \uc2  The National Bank of Poland set the parity rate for the dollar at 3.2102 zlotys and for the mark at 1.8856 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  The dollar was trading at 2.35% below its parity rate, and the mark was at 2.70% below its parity rate. \par \par \uc2  The Polish zloty is fixed to a basket of five Western \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  and is devalued at a rate of 1% per month. It is allowed to fluctuate within plus or minus 7% of the central parity rate. \par \par \uc2  Overnight money market rates were indicated at between 20.50% and 20.80%. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 22-04-97 \par \par \uc2  0930GMT \par \par \uc2  1167 1854 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt4m02x17\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
