1% per month. It is allowed to fluctuate within plus or minus 7% of the central parity rate. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Overnight money market rates were indicated at 20.70% to 21.20%.\par -0-   l\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 21-04-97\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 1027GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1167 1854 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt4l02teb\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
