\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Poland \highlight\uc2  Zloty Weakens Slightly Vs Basket After  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 287 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1997\par 11:45\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  WARSAW (AP-Dow Jones)--The Polish zloty weakened slightly against the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket on Thursday following the previous day's minimal \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Around 1025 GMT, the dollar was at 3.0720 zlotys, down from 3.0734 zlotys at the opening and from Wednesday's fixing of 3.0745 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  The Deutsche mark was at 1.8335 zlotys, up from 1.8288 zlotys at the opening and from Wednesday's fixing of 1.8270 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the market late on Wednesday buying dollars for zlotys at the level of 3.0708 zlotys and 3.0713 zlotys. One dealer said the scale of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was in the low millions of dollars. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's action was seen as a reminder that it wouldn't allow the zloty to rise to more than an average of 3% above the parity rates for the dollar and mark, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  On Thursday, the market was calm, with the zloty tracking movements in the dollar-mark on international markets. \par \par \uc2  The National Bank of Poland set the parity rate for the dollar at 3.1682 zlotys and for the mark at 1.8830 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  The dollar was trading at 3.13% below its parity rate, and the mark was at 2.7% below its parity rate. \par \par \uc2  The Polish zloty is fixed to a basket of five Western \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  and is devalued at a rate of 1% per month. It is allowed to fluctuate within plus or minus 7% of the central parity rate. \par \par \uc2  Overnight money market rates were indicated at between 22.40% and 22.60%. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 20-03-97 \par \par \uc2  1045GMT \par \par \uc2  1167 1854 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt3k020jb\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
