\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Poland \highlight\uc2 's Zloty Down Sharply Vs Dollar After  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 306 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 19 Februar 1997\par 13:30\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  WARSAW (AP-Dow Jones)--The Polish zloty fell sharply against the dollar following \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Around 1215 GMT, the dollar was at 3.0523 zlotys, up 3.0255 zlotys at the opening but down from Tuesday's fixing of 3.0370 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  The Deutsche mark was at 1.8030 zlotys, up from 1.7971 zlotys before the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  and from Tuesday's fixing of 1.7855 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  three times to buy dollars for zlotys at the level of 3.0337 zlotys, 3.0355 zlotys and 3.0360 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  Some dealers estimated the scale of the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  at about $25 million. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the zloty's sharp drop against the dollar was an over-reaction to the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's move, and that the zloty still has room to move up again. \par \par \uc2  A dealer at Bank Rozwoju Eksportu said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will accept a zloty that is about 3% stronger than the parity rate for the dollar. \par \par \uc2  'It's a question of a couple of days, and the upward pressure (on the zloty) will start up again,' he said. \par \par \uc2  The National Bank of Poland set the parity rate for the dollar at 3.1377 zlotys and for the mark at 1.8635 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  The dollar was trading at 2.8% below its parity rate, and the mark was at 3.36% below its parity rate. \par \par \uc2  The Polish zloty is fixed to a basket of five Western \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  and is devalued at a rate of 1% per month. It is allowed to fluctuate within plus or minus 7% of the central parity rate. \par \par \uc2  Overnight money market rates were indicated at between 20.40% and 20.90%. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 19-02-97 \par \par \uc2  1230GMT \par \par \uc2  1167 1854 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt2j015qt\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
