\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Poland \highlight\uc2  Zloty Slips Vs Basket On  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Expectations \b0\par\par\uc2 210 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 19 Februar 1997\par 11:25\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  WARSAW (AP-Dow Jones)--The Polish zloty weakened against the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket on Wednesday amid expectations that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Around 1010 GMT, the dollar was at 3.0340 zlotys, up from 3.0255 zlotys at the opening but down from Tuesday's fixing of 3.0370 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  The Deutsche mark was at 1.7971, up from Tuesday's fixing of 1.7855 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  'The zloty has been moving up toward the boundaries of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , and nobody wants to risk' drawing purchases of dollars or marks by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , one dealer said. \par \par \uc2  The National Bank of Poland set the parity rate for the dollar at 3.1377 zlotys and for the mark at 1.8635 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  The dollar was trading at 3.42% below its parity rate, and the mark was at 3.70% below its parity rate. \par \par \uc2  The Polish zloty is fixed to a basket of five Western \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  and is devalued at a rate of 1% per month. It is allowed to fluctuate within plus or minus 7% of the central parity rate. \par \par \uc2  Overnight money market rates were indicated at between 20.40% and 20.90%. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 19-02-97 \par \par \uc2  1025GMT \par \par \uc2  1167 1854 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt2j015jc\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
