\par\par \b \uc2  Poland's Zloty -2:  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2  Remarks Ruffle Market \b0\par\par\uc2 207 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 Januar 1997\par 11:53\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  Remarks Tuesday by National Bank of Poland Vice President Witold Kozinski added to the uncertainty surrounding the course of the zloty. \par \par \uc2  Kozinski, explaining last week's heavy \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to buy dollars and marks for zlotys, said the Polish \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's strength had been 'groundless' given the country's widening current-account deficit. \par \par \uc2  'The market is disoriented,' said a dealer at Amerbank, who added that the dollar's sudden recovery against the zloty was caused by the expectation that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  may \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to buy dollars. \par \par \uc2  The National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland\b0 \highlight\uc2  set the parity rate for the dollar at 3.0868 zlotys and for the mark at 1.8666 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  The dollar was trading at about 2.3% below its parity rate, and the mark was at 2.21% below its parity rate. \par \par \uc2  The Polish zloty is fixed to a basket of five Western \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  and is devalued at a rate of 1% per month. In theorery, it is allowed to fluctuate within plus or minus 7% of the central parity rate. \par \par \uc2  Overnight money market rates were indicated at between 21.75% and 21.85%. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 29-01-97 \par \par \uc2  1053GMT \par \par \uc2  1167 1854 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt1t00kdo\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
