nk\b0 \highlight\uc2  refrained from draining \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Monday. \par \par \uc2  At 0950 GMT overnight deposits were quoted at 20.90/21.15 percent against opening's 20.90/21.20 percent, tomorrow/next were at 21.00/21.25 percent against Friday's 21.10/21.25 percent.  -- Krzysztof Wojcik +48 22 653 9700 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011002dt1r010ud\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
