\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Poland \highlight\uc2 's Zloty Creeps Up Vs Basket;  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Feared \b0\par\par\uc2 319 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 Januar 1997\par 10:43\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  WARSAW (AP-Dow Jones)--The Polish zloty rose slightly against the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket Tuesday in volatile dealing as market players wondered whether the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  again, as it did on Monday. \par \par \uc2  Around 0925 GMT, the dollar was at 2.9565 zlotys, up from 2.9525 zlotys at the opening but down slightly from Monday's fixing of 2.9570 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  The Deutsche mark was at 1.8159 zlotys, down from 1.8165 zlotys at the opening and Monday's fixing of 1.8205 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  'Banks are selling dollars,' said a Bogdan Golen of Bank Rozwoju Eksportu. 'They are testing the patience' of the National Bank of Poland, he said. \par \par \uc2  But dealers said spreads were wide and turnover was small, with banks fearing they may draw \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . But some dealers speculated that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  may not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  directly on the market but drive the zloty down at the fixing. \par \par \uc2  'The market is like a see-saw,' said a dealer at a major Western bank. \par \par \uc2  The National Bank of Poland set the parity rate for the dollar at 3.0455 zlotys and mark at 1.8747 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  The dollar was trading at about 3.01% below its parity rate, and the mark was at 3.24% below its parity rate. \par \par \uc2  On Monday, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought dollars and Deutsche marks for zlotys, driving the zloty down from an average of more than 4% above the parity rate for the two \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  to about 2.8%. \par \par \uc2  The Polish zloty is fixed to a basket of five Western \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  and is devalued at a rate of 1% per month. It is theoretically allowed to fluctuate within plus or minus 7% of the central parity rate. \par \par \uc2  Overnight money market rates were indicated at between 21.65% and 21.95%. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 21-01-97 \par \par \uc2  0943GMT \par \par \uc2  1167 1854 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt1l00eu1\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
