\par\par \b \uc2  Poland Zloty Fall Seen Due To Exporters' Political Muscle \b0\par\par\uc2  By Christopher Wellisz \par \uc2 246 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 Januar 1997\par 18:44\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  WARSAW (AP-Dow Jones)--The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  Monday to slow the rise of the zloty - whose recent strength in the face of weak current account and trade data has surprised many - may be due to pressure by politically powerful exporters for a weaker \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  ended more than a half-year of inactivity on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market Monday by \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  to buy dollars and Deutsche marks when they fell below 4% of their parity rates. \par \par \uc2  There was little consensus among dealers on whether the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland\b0 \highlight\uc2  had established a new \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  level, or, if they have, what that level was. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  started buying dollars with zlotys at 2.9205 zlotys, dealers said. The bank bought dollars two more times, ending at 2.9540 zlotys, dealers said. The bank also bought marks at 1.7965 zlotys, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  By the time dealing petered out at around 1338 GMT, the the dollar was at 2.9515 zlotys, or about 3% below the central parity rate. The Deutsche mark was at 1.8180 zlotys, or about 3.14% below the parity rate. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  later fixed the dollar at 2.9570 zlotys and the mark at 1.8205 zlotys. That meant that on average the dollar and mark were 2.8% below their parity rates. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 20-01-97 \par \par \uc2  1744GMT \par \par \uc2  1143 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt1k00e2z\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
