\par\par \b \uc2  Zloty firmer vs basket, one-day revrepo rate up. \b0\par\par\uc2 408 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 Dezember 1996\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1996 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  WARSAW, Dec 16 (Reuter) - The Polish zloty firmed against the basket of \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  on a light \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 -selling trend on inflows from exchange bureaux which prevented the unit from falling despite a stronger world dollar, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  They said the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  selling was likley to be seasonal because of increased cross border shopping in Poland before the Christmas holidays. \par \par \uc2  "A simple explanation of the slight \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  ovresupply on the market is that it comes from a seasonal inflow from exchange bureaux before the (Christmas) holidays," said one dealer at a foreign bank here. \par \par \uc2  The zloty closed up at 2.96/2.93 percent from the parity rate against Friday's close at 2.91/2.83 percent. It closed at 2.8615/27 to the dollar, down from 2.8505/25 on Friday and at 1.8403/09 to the mark, up from 1.8520/30. \par \par \uc2  Poland had a current account deficit of $425 million in October bringing the shortfall in the January-October period to $859 million, the National Bank of Poland said. \par \par \uc2  The NBP has earlier said the deteriorating current account with the deficit expected at about $3.9 billion next year from this year's expected $300 million would strongly limit the zloty's upside potential. \par \par \uc2  Analysts said that so far the zloty was well protected from falling by a constant flow of \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  from privatisation deals and capital increases of foreign companies operating in \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "Unless the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would take the cost of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the zloty is likely to occupy a strong position at three percent from parity with some 0.2 point swings," said Marcin Stefaniuk from Bank Depozytowo-Kredytowy SA. \par \par \uc2  One-day deposit rates eased under the pressure of reserve surpluses of some banks, but rates were undrepinned at 21 percent by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's reverse repo rate. \par \par \uc2  The NBP drained 689 million zlotys off the market for one-day raising the maximum accepted rate by 0.2 point to 21.50 percent. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the market was fairly liquid on Monday, but rates were unlikely to fall below the level signalled by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Overnight rates were at 21.00/22.00 percent from opening's 22.0/22.4 percent, tomorrow/next rates were at 21.00/22.00 percent, down from 22.0/22.45 percent. \par \par \uc2  -- Krzysztof Wojcik +48 22 653 9700 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1996 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011019dscg029q1\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
