\par\par \b \uc2  Poland Zloty Dips Vs  \highlight22\uc2 Currency \highlight\uc2  Basket But Regains Ground \b0\par\par\uc2 325 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 Dezember 1996\par 11:43\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  WARSAW (AP-Dow Jones)--The Polish zloty was slightly stronger against the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket on Tuesday after dipping after the market opened. \par \par \uc2  Around 1011 GMT, the dollar was at 2.8625 zlotys, down from 2.8630 zlotys at the opening, but up from Monday's fixing of 2.8580 zlotys. The dollar briefly reached a high of 2.8660 zlotys before slipping, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The Deutsche mark was at 1.8417 zlotys, up from 1.8395 zlotys at the opening and from Monday's fixing of 1.8410 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  'In the morning, there was buying of hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  for zlotys and a slight weakening of the zloty,' said Bogdan Stepkowski of ING Bank. 'But now the market has returned to a stronger zloty.' \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the zloty would show strength for as long as short-term interest rates remain high on the interbank money market. \par \par \uc2  Some dealers were wondering whether the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to buy hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  for zlotys, but they said there were no signs of imminent action. \par \par \uc2  Marcin Trzygowski of Bank Polska Kasa Opieki said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would likely allow the zloty to rise to an average of about 3% above the parity rates for the dollar and mark. \par \par \uc2  On Tuesday morning, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  set the parity rate for the dollar at 2.9635 zlotys and for the mark at 1.8410 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  The dollar was trading at 2.58% below its parity rate, while the mark was about 3.03% below its parity rate. \par \par \uc2  The Polish zloty is fixed to a basket of five Western \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  and is devalued at a rate of 1% per month. It is allowed to fluctuate within plus or minus 7% of the central parity rate. \par \par \uc2  Overnight money market rates were indicated between 24.85% and 25.00%. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 10-12-96 \par \par \uc2  1043GMT \par \par \uc2  1167 1854 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011014dsca01n4f\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
