\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Poland \highlight\uc2  Zloty Gains Sharply Vs Basket;  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Feared \b0\par\par\uc2 293 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 Dezember 1996\par 11:48\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  WARSAW (AP-Dow Jones)--The Polish zloty was sharply higher against the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket in active dealing on Tuesday, sparking fears of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Some dealers said foreign direct investors adding capital to their Polish subsidiaries before the year-end are buying zlotys for hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Around 1000 GMT, the dollar was at 2.8645 zlotys, down from 2.8680 zlotys at the opening but up from Monday's fixing of 2.8485 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  The Deutsche mark was at 1.8309 zlotys, down from Monday's fixing of 1.8460 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the dollar's gains against the zloty didn't match its rise against the mark, leaving the Polish \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  stronger against the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket as a whole. \par \par \uc2  The National Bank of Poland set the parity rate for the dollar at 2.9181 zlotys and for the mark at 1.8931 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  The dollar was trading at about 1.87% below its parity rate, while the mark was trading at 3.4% below its parity rate. \par \par \uc2  Against the basket as a whole, the zloty was more than 2.5% above parity. That is the level at which the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to buy hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the past. \par \par \uc2  Nevertheless, 'I think the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will wait for developments' before \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2 , said a dealer at a major Western bank in Warsaw. \par \par \uc2  The Polish zloty is fixed to a basket of five Western \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  and is devalued at a rate of 1% per month. It is allowed to fluctuate within plus or minus 7% of the central parity rate. \par \par \uc2  Overnight money market rates were indicated at between 22.50% and 23.00%. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 03-12-96 \par \par \uc2  1048GMT \par \par \uc2  1167 1854 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011014dsc301eo5\par }\par \b \uc2 Zusammenfassung der Suche\b0\par \par  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Text\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 (foreign exchange or fx or forex or currenc*) and (interven* or operation*) and (poland near10 interven*) and (rst=trtw or rst=tprw or rst=tdjw) and (central bank or ministry of finance or treasury ministry or monetary authority)\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\row } \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Datum\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 01/01/1995 bis 21/08/2023\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 { 